# .publishignore — keep specific reports OUT of the public ai-infra-deepdive repo.
#
# publish.sh archives EVERY dated report from the Obsidian vault's "04 Reports/"
# into archive/ so nothing is ever silently dropped. This repo is PUBLIC, so any
# file committed here (homepage slug OR archive/) is web-reachable.
#
# To exclude a report, add one filename glob per line (matched against the vault
# filename, not the slug). Examples:
#   Options-Mastery-Dashboard_*.html
#   *_PRIVATE_*.html
#   *_DRAFT_*.html
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored. Nothing is excluded by default.
portfolio_snapshot*.json
